* Privacy - AI systems should protect user privacy and personal data; 
* Accountability - developers should be held accountable for any negative consequences caused by their AI system;
* Fairness - AI systems should not discriminate against any individual or group;
* Safety - developers must ensure their AI systems are secure and cannot be used for malicious activities;
